#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:7 b5d1af6d22774c859cd8c48745d85b24
msgid "SPEDIX H743"
msgstr "SPEDIX H743"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:8 d864355457bc4b868acf7a1fb3d6bb20
msgid "The SPEDIX H743 is a flight controller based on the STM32H743 MCU."
msgstr "SPEDIX H743 是基于 STM32H743 MCU 的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:11 e59a269c4cd147d78969c357958dea03
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:12 d7ae583a30ae45f78cc05d1cc90c3963
msgid "MCU - STM32H743 32-bit processor running at 480 MHz"
msgstr "MCU - STM32H743 32位处理器，运行频率480 MHz"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:13 4a5887fb5d574015a3a1edd101e91be7
msgid "IMU - Dual ICM42688"
msgstr "IMU - 双 ICM42688"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:14 63d6bc5646034da6b73298166bd04bde
msgid "Barometer - SPL06"
msgstr "气压计 - SPL06"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:15 d187844c8af94018a0512858c14f3f51
msgid "OSD - MAX7456"
msgstr "OSD - MAX7456"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:16 88ff00ad8ca54a50b068f78775f55ab4
msgid "8x UARTs"
msgstr "8路 UART"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:17 a218e7e2c2704a43bf7497f024834007
msgid "CAN support"
msgstr "CAN 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:18 9bd6515c26a5428498c0c4bb6e34cf56
msgid "9x PWM Outputs (8 Motor Output, 1 LED)"
msgstr "9路 PWM 输出（8路电机输出，1路 LED）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:19 1c98ed37b2cb42c6a7647632148b763a
msgid "Battery input voltage: 2S-6S"
msgstr "电池输入电压：2S-6S"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:20 709924d0900a4e3d911a04e2e85adf6b
msgid "BEC 3.3V 0.5A"
msgstr "BEC 3.3V 0.5A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:21 d54160c6872245278a46f9938c96a966
msgid "BEC 5V 3A"
msgstr "BEC 5V 3A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:22 8cf3669e0c5a4e06b222c8d23da4ef1d
msgid "BEC 12V 3A for video, gpio controlled"
msgstr "BEC 12V 3A，用于视频，GPIO 控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:23 01bc5c393bdb4a0695511e8528569d84
msgid "Dual camera inputs with switching support"
msgstr "支持切换的双摄像头输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:26 b8b3ffabedde4b178115303a23a8b125
msgid "Pinout"
msgstr "引脚定义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:31 6277870d984246009e99816cba5b167f
msgid "UART Mapping"
msgstr "UART 映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:32 e740caec831c400abf20f34d75857230
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:33 5c94c3b491004d3f98a25e8d73a4cddd
msgid "SERIAL1 -> UART1 (Telem 1, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> UART1（数传1，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:34 4511c95b9fe94676b5b0161fc1f88a98
msgid "SERIAL2 -> UART2 (RC Input, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> UART2（RC 输入，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:35 982bd197f78d473595d82292d7fd5617
msgid "SERIAL3 -> UART3 (Telem 2, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> UART3（数传2，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:36 27fa510363d149c4806e5e4c27af8ecb
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (MSP DisplayPort, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（MSP DisplayPort，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:37 e658ea1bfedf45af863d732b5fa664a9
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART5 (ESC Telemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（ESC 数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:38 792924b1af1b43dc9e61b0a5b48a551c
msgid "SERIAL6 -> UART6 (GPS, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（GPS，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:39 daedc23ec241410ab938f25a51554241
msgid "SERIAL7 -> UART7 (Spare)"
msgstr "SERIAL7 -> UART7（备用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:40 ac4b52a9d3704b8e915d391ac8a4eba9
msgid "SERIAL8 -> UART8 (OTG2)"
msgstr "SERIAL8 -> UART8（OTG2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:43 9a540da4de77405ea1c41b3902eb1e09
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:44 acd3bac2a0e14aca96924e677624b4ce
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART2. It supports all serial RC "
"protocols except PPM."
msgstr "RC 输入默认通过 USART2 配置。支持除 PPM 之外的所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:46 5cbd791f9a95499ab0300267fbf05982
msgid ""
"FPort: the receiver must be also tied to the USART2 TX pin , "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` set to 3, and "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` must be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half"
" duplex)."
msgstr ""
"FPort：接收机还必须连接到 USART2 TX 引脚，:ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` "
"设为3，:ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 必须设为7（反转 TX/RX，半双工）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:47 8d991d4d83e143fca3f48bc25535d77e
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS use both RX2 and TX2 and set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` to 3."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS 同时使用 RX2 和 TX2，并将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 设为3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:50 73274692d8d943bdb07887871d6cc35f
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:51 8777779cc8c54896b0e20643664fba0b
msgid ""
"Onboard OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) is supported by default. "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort OSD is available on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"默认支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的板载 OSD。同时，HD VTX 连接器上也提供 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:54 7f1317d85589437781e832032fe78b51
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:55 585cfbb78a5042c9b90489c992a20801
msgid ""
"The SPEDIX F405 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 "
"to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus "
"M9 on a separate pad for LED strip (default configuration) or another PWM "
"output."
msgstr ""
"SPEDIX F405 最多支持9路 PWM 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M8 的焊盘在电机连接器和独立焊盘上均有提供，另有 M9 在独立焊盘上，默认用于"
" LED 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:59 823de029dac340ceb2460712aed2f38d
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为4个组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:61 03e66881de804677acd85b030a245877
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在组1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:62 8a83dc7da7b144a29ed7ccdd041742f4
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在组2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:63 d8a5332eeeac42f7a74714306d17b9e9
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 在组3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:64 99389025f5d14d688214055e1039ae53
msgid "PWM 9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在组4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:66 60522fc494fc48c1843e457607f03737
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。通道1-8支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:71 13f9ac54a51e4739bddde1b7e43f4876
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:72 b663a55190e0487ea5a4f7a27c17ea16
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries. The correct battery "
"setting parameters are:"
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器最高支持6S锂电池。正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:74 3b9df987e81a45509f0382b440c38982
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:75 9259d605995a4b76b63585bf3be25c09
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:76 b0be8d3d683942ee88ddf9e91a8d93c9
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11 (CURR pin)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11（CURR 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:77 85a55c1ef6344018bce06768481b6784
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:78 a3399dc19ded46bd941a5a1c0bfdd28c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 25 (depends"
" on sensor used)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"25（取决于使用的传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:81 57d27e4868244f69b46d03c12b74ac1e
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:82 9369ad9f05b9403bb5360003ced613bd
msgid "No onboard compass. Use external I2C compass via SDA/SCL pads."
msgstr "无板载罗盘。通过 SDA/SCL 焊盘使用外部 I2C 罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:85 287d2b5be52b452a9b67f9f5fc845984
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:86 ba47ba5d008b42a0a4064b20c60e924b
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\" and is included "
"on the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to "
"this pin/pad. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets "
"the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标记为「12V」的引脚，并包含在 HD VTX 连接器上。将此 GPIO "
"设置为低电平会切断该引脚/焊盘的电源。默认情况下，RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:89 2ff8c76cda9349ba857ccdb05198e607
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:90 3fb06592746840ae87420acf230db3c1
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 控制相机输出到标记为「CAM1」和「CAM2」的连接器。将此 GPIO 设置为低电平可将视频输出从 CAM1 切换到 "
"CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY4 配置为控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:93 e8a015b9c9144c5fbda40f995feaaf47
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:94 b63ba71e56f54d26bfceeeddcb5b3080
msgid ""
"Firmware for the SPEDIX H743 is available from `ArduPilot Firmware Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ under the ``SPEDIXH743`` target."
msgstr ""
"SPEDIX H743 的固件可从 `ArduPilot 固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ "
"获取，目标名称为 ``SPEDIXH743``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:97 bb07a43432a840b3a3eec1f7ff51ad3f
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:98 87b1c18ad5e24f7b9f296508c07680e5
msgid ""
"Use DFU (USB + BOOT button) to flash ``with_bl.hex`` for first time. Use "
"``.apj`` files for subsequent updates via ground station."
msgstr "使用 DFU（USB + BOOT 按钮）首次烧录 ``with_bl.hex``。后续更新通过地面站使用 ``.apj`` 文件进行。"
